roblems.]  \n\n(Studio: Charles Gibson)  Report introduced.  \n\n(Belton, Missouri: Ron Claiborne)  McCain's attack strategy against Obama's economic plan as a taxer and a socialist featured; scenes shown from the campaign in Missouri, including McCain meeting with small business owners.  [McCAIN&nbsp- says Obama wants to spread the wealth around.]  [Governor Sarah PALIN&nbsp- speaks against socialism.]  [Republican strategist Kevin MADDEN&#134;- outlines the Republican strategy.]  Palin's appearance on \"Saturday Night Live\" shown.  \n\n(Studio: Charles Gibson; Washington: George Stephanopoulos)  The daily ABC News tracking poll findings separating McCain from President Bush, on the issue of taxes, who can better handle a crisis and the advantage for Obama among enthusiastic voters discussed. ", "segment_duration": 480, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 908818, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "jV4PoZ4dl3", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-20", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 908817, "segment_id": "4vzrsZTUCe", "segment_broadcast_id": "jV4PoZ4dl3", "segment_title": "What's the Difference (Taxes)", "segment_description": "(Studio: Charles Gibson)  The tax debate between presidential candidates Senators John McCain and Barack Obama introduced.   (New York: Bill Weir)  The tax plans from Obama and McCain compared; statistics on policy cited with examples of tax by income level cited.  [OBAMA, McCAIN&nbsp- talk about the level for being rich.]  [Tax Policy Center Len BURMAN&#134;- assesses McCain's tax plan; compares low- and high-income households.]  T